WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.210
“Wait. That’s my voice?”

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.203
Vibrations also travel
through the bones and

00:00:05.243 --> 00:00:08.070
tissues of your head
to your inner ear.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:10.762
An ordinary microphone
records the sound

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.880
reaching it
through the air.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.734
It doesn’t capture and
recreate the vibrations

00:00:15.774 --> 00:00:18.670
traveling through your
head while you speak.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.052
You’re hearing a
familiar voice from a

00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:22.730
less familiar position.

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.490
That’s Why Is That?
